  "title": "ElevenLabs Expands Voice AI Services to 22 Indian Languages",
  "summary": "ElevenLabs is expanding its voice AI services to cover all 22 Indian languages, aiming to offer a more natural and accessible AI experience for users. The company plans to include the service in both local and global markets.",
